      "sourceHash": "9bdb59b3f7ae44fc",
      "translationZh": "镜头飞越服务器的昏暗走廊。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "41e2d77c9ee66dd2",
      "translationZh": "出现在巨大的城市中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b18b8bb74f9ab9a",
      "translationZh": "揭示沉睡中的机械生物。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "28c502e7a72693dc",
      "translationZh": "标题：QWEN FLASH // 觉醒",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "188336b579cd150b",
      "translationZh": "流畅过渡到游戏玩法。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ec7f7725f0841dfb",
      "translationZh": "开场介绍绝不能妨碍游戏启动。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ff7a768737bb2695",
      "translationZh": "加入一个醒目的“开始 / 进入模拟”按钮。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e22fc17d08baf241",
      "translationZh": "按钮和初始化逻辑必须健壮，并经过严格测试：避免竞态条件、缺失的事件监听器、未定义的对象、异步加载问题，以及可能导致演示卡住的启动状态。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "486162f02b4c045e",
      "translationZh": "单个 HTML 文件。* 可立即在现代桌面浏览器中运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a8f218244eb6f135",
      "translationZh": "无需构建系统。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "98b2513ee1df47e6",
      "translationZh": "未下载任何外部模型、纹理或图形资源。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c350ceb20390c809",
      "translationZh": "基于几何体和材质，以程序化方式生成视觉效果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "df3e89d08726fb0a",
      "translationZh": "与 Three.js 兼容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cea24df58cd17e0e",
      "translationZh": "尽管代码精简至单个文件，仍保持结构清晰。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f27c7e85dafe8431",
      "translationZh": "随浏览器窗口大小变化正确调整尺寸。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3dde6be761b8dbc0",
      "translationZh": "优雅地处理未连接游戏手柄的情况。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aefdbd92423cf40f",
      "translationZh": "绝不在函数或变量初始化之前引用它们。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0be9550010c7650f",
      "translationZh": "避免过多的渲染调用：在适当情况下使用 InstancedMesh、合并几何体、对象分组和 LOD。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "445525faa7ddb186",
      "translationZh": "移除不可见或远处的对象。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e9a49fbd521a816d",
      "translationZh": "根据距离和性能，动态限制同时存在的粒子、无人机和车辆数量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "96b97a3bae4e272c",
      "translationZh": "在现代游戏显卡上实现最佳性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "86106c6b3f11c115",
      "translationZh": "添加一个小巧、不显眼的界面，用于显示性能信息：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "17d5c4aa2168eeed",
      "translationZh": "可见体素/实例数量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b26a77ce7a55a20",
      "translationZh": "当每秒帧数大幅下降时，自动减少消耗大量资源的背景元素。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c1381a952db7af14",
      "translationZh": "在发生大幅机械运动时，镜头轻微抖动",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3732087d8bce28d9",
      "translationZh": "在能量脉冲出现时产生视觉闪光",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ed83992c3b7cc89e",
      "translationZh": "由 Web Audio API 程序化生成的环境音效",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ed37d159ed959067",
      "translationZh": "反应堆的低频嗡鸣",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "68e8b9a507be531d",
      "translationZh": "冷却风扇",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4243aa33db170f0f",
      "translationZh": "在条件允许时，让声音随空间位置变化",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "17879ef428577ef6",
      "translationZh": "不使用任何外部音频文件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "02eac373c559dcea",
      "translationZh": "不要只是机械地逐项打勾了事。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "177bdc67098361c8",
      "translationZh": "利用主题推导出更多合乎逻辑的环境细节、行为和动画，让这样一个规模庞大、充满活力的 AI 数据中心显得可信。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8389d8f5fc24bbbc",
      "translationZh": "优先突出视觉叙事、规模感、运动和氛围。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1f8f9ecf4e9ac1fe",
      "translationZh": "对 Unsloth 的提及应保持为一个巧妙且在视觉上令人难忘的彩蛋，让本地模型爱好者立即注意到并欣赏它，而最主要的情感回报仍然是巨型机械生物 Qwen 的苏醒。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0106",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "446412ca9495b3a6",
      "translationZh": "结果应让人立即产生这样的反应：“一个本地模型到底怎么能生成这种东西？”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0107",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0adf3c9651e6c6ff",
      "translationZh": "仅返回完整的、可执行的 HTML 文件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0108",
